.DS_Store
*.swp

# web/ — the assayd.io and assayd.dev workspace.
# Installed trees, build output, and Astro's generated type cache. The
# pnpm lockfile is NOT ignored: it is the pin that makes a build reproducible.
#
# Anchored to web/ deliberately. A bare `dist/` here would also swallow a
# future Go or chart build directory anywhere in the tree, which is the kind
# of ignore rule that hides a generated artifact nobody meant to drop.
web/**/node_modules/
web/**/dist/
web/**/.astro/
web/.build.log
